# This comparison utility intentionally lives beside its local MCAP inputs.
!Locomotion_part/viobot_ctrl/scripts/data/
Locomotion_part/viobot_ctrl/scripts/data/*
!Locomotion_part/viobot_ctrl/scripts/data/visualize_baton_insight_comparison.py
# 仅跟踪人工维护的数据集状态文档，继续忽略 RouteServer/data 下的运行数据。
!Agent_part/RouteServer/data/
Agent_part/RouteServer/data/*
!Agent_part/RouteServer/data/DATASET_ANNOTATION_STATUS.md
# RouteServer 的 Python 数据合同/转换器是源码，不属于运行时数据目录。
!Agent_part/RouteServer/src/mcp_server/data/
!Agent_part/RouteServer/src/mcp_server/data/*.py
Agent_part/RouteServer/examples/agent_eval/
Agent_part/RouteServer/tests/fixtures/
